   - Also, the "SYNTHESIS CHECKPOINT" reminder text must not say "exploration is complete" while the plan is open. If plan is open at saturation_round>=2 the phase is no longer "synthesis" so that branch doesn't fire. Good — the reminder is tied to the phase.
